# SPEC Updates

When building out new features or changing existing behavior, update **SPEC.md** in the same change—not only code.

Cover what operators and contributors need at the architecture level: UI states and transitions, triggers and reversion, data model, OBS/webhook flows, and settings. Reserve **MANUAL.md** for end-user how-to; **SPEC.md** is the product spec and state machine.

If the change is user-visible but not architectural, MANUAL alone may suffice; when in doubt, update both.
